flowchart TD
    A([caller]) -->|isbn, cached=True| B[get_thumbnail_url]

    B --> C{cached=True?}
    C -->|yes| D[build cache_key\nprefix_isbn]
    D --> E{cache hit?}
    E -->|yes| F[parse JSON\nurl + provider]
    F --> Z([return url, provider])

    E -->|no| G
    C -->|no| G[read PROVIDERS list\nfrom app.config]

    G --> H{providers\nempty?}
    H -->|yes| Y[return None, None]

    H -->|no| I[for each provider_name]
    I --> J{name in\nPROVIDERS?}
    J -->|no – KeyError| K[log warning\nskip]
    K --> I

    J -->|yes| L[instantiate provider\ncls]
    L --> M[provider.get_thumbnail_url\nisbn]
    M -->|exception| N[log error\nskip]
    N --> I

    M -->|url, provider_name| O{url found?}
    O -->|no| I

    O -->|yes| P{cached=True?}
    P -->|yes| Q[cache.set\nJSON url+provider]
    Q --> Z
    P -->|no| Z

    I -->|exhausted| R{cached=True?}
    R -->|yes| S[cache.set\nJSON null+last_provider]
    S --> T([return None, last_provider])
    R -->|no| T

    subgraph providers [registered providers – entry points resolved at registry build]
        BNF[BnfProvider\nbnf]
        DNB[DnbProvider\ndnb]
        FILES[FilesProvider\nfiles]
        GAPI[GoogleApiProvider\ngoogle api]
        GBOOKS[GoogleBooksProvider\ngoogle books]
        OL[OpenLibraryProvider\nopen library]
    end

    L -.->|instantiate from\nPROVIDERS registry| providers
